      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T00:34:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that is an interesting point. We do not currently have AC insert/remove as wake events. Ravi -- is this something that can be detected by powerd? Probably powerd will have to worry about individual PD events here?",
